# Quant Execution Microstructure

Read `SKILL.md` before making changes. Preserve event-time ordering, parent-child order lineage, realistic partial fills, queue and latency assumptions, side-correct cost signs, pre-trade controls, and post-trade reconciliation.

Default to historical simulation or paper trading. Do not submit, cancel, or modify live orders, promise returns, or present output as personalized investment advice.
